Planned guarded source changes:
- Change releaseNativeResources() to return IOReturn and propagate quiesce, staged-packet recycle, PCI fence and backend-close failures.
- Move PCI bus-master fence to immediately after RTW88 radio stop and before RX adapter / queue / pool destruction.
- Make controller free() quarantine the controller (retain its workloop/resources and do not call super::free) whenever cleanup cannot be proven complete. This deliberately prefers a bounded leak over a use-after-free/DMA use-after-free on the failure path.
- On partial PCI enable, attempt rollback and preserve the backend's active/quarantine state if bus mastering remains enabled.
- In PCI backend free(), verify the bus-master bit is clear before releasing DMA memory; otherwise leave the backend/resources quarantined.
- The runner checks exact source shape/counts, creates timestamped backups and unified diffs, and aborts before writes if guards fail.

